      "filename": "RQ-11A Raven 3896a (2151970963).jpg",
      "title": "File:RQ-11A Raven 3896a (2151970963).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/RQ-11A_Raven_3896a_%282151970963%29.jpg",
